[4.071,"o","── PLAN · nothing below has run ───────────────────────────────────────\r\nThis is what ov does in your Azure subscription (location northeurope); --debug shows every command:\r\n\r\n  1. SSH key: the stack's own key pair, its public half handed to the template (.openvidu/azure/ov-e2eh-a124207-key.pub)\r\n  2. Template: render the high availability template into .openvidu/azure/cf-openvidu-pro-ha.bicep\r\n     and its secure parameters into .openvidu/azure/secure-parameters.json (0600)\r\n  3. Resource group: create ov-e2eh-a124207-rg in northeurope\r\n  4. Machines: Create the deployment ov-e2eh-a124207 with the four masters and the media nodes: master-1 installs OpenVidu and the rest join it (about 8 minutes)\r\n  5. Wait for OpenVidu to be up, read what it published (URL, credentials) and register this directory as the stack\r\n── end of plan ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n\r\n▶ Create the machines on Azure…\r\n"]
